// §25-27: a real (if simple) working-hours calendar — man-hours and times a
// shift actually runs, with how many people crew it. Recurs weekly on the
// given days. Scoped to a work centre (every resource in it) or, if set, one
// specific resource. Planners manage these directly; nothing here is
// generated from routings. The naive 40h/week placeholder in capacity
// reporting is used only where a work centre/resource has no shifts at all —
// configuring shifts is optional, not mandatory, to stay flexible for a
// smaller manufacturer who doesn't need the detail yet.
model ManufacturingShift {
 id String @id @default(cuid())
 organisationId String
 workCentreId String
 resourceId String?
 label String @default("")
