// §35-39: MRP output. A suggestion is a recommendation, never an executable
// order itself (§40) — firming a MAKE suggestion creates a real ManufacturingOrder.
// `pegging` captures the demand this suggestion exists to cover (§37), stored as a
// JSON array of {sourceType, sourceId, label, quantity} so it survives even if the
// underlying sales order line is later edited.
